 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Juniper Falls, every door of one hotel opens onto a different year.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "One stay per life, so people save it till they're gray.",
   "tag": "[playful]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Mom never laughed. She only smiled about one friend:",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Poppy, who vanished the summer they were twelve.",
   "tag": "[wistful]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "On her twelfth birthday, Poppy wore her yellow raincoat and asked for 1994.",
   "speak": "On her twelfth birthday, Poppy wore her yellow raincoat and asked for nineteen ninety-four.",
   "tag": "[determined]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“One summer. When the bell rings, come home. Never say who you are.”",
   "speak": "One summer. When the bell rings, come home. Never say who you are.",
   "voice": "bellhop",
   "tag": "[old, kind, serious]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Behind the door, a girl hung from an oak, tangled in her kite.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "It was Mom, at twelve.",
   "tag": "[stunned, quiet]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“Help! I'm Dot!”",
   "speak": "Help! I'm Dot!",
   "voice": "dot",
   "tag": "[cheerful, strained]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“Uh... Poppy.”",
   "speak": "Uh... Poppy.",
   "voice": "poppy",
   "tag": "[nervous, quick]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "They flew kites, built a raft, and Dot laughed till she hiccuped.",
   "tag": "[happy]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it hit her. Mom's lost friend was her.",
   "tag": "[realizing, quick]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "The last evening, the bell rang. Dot tied a bracelet on her wrist.",
   "tag": "[gentle, sad]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“Will I see you again?”",
   "speak": "Will I see you again?",
   "voice": "dot",
   "tag": "[sad, hopeful]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“Every single day.”",
   "speak": "Every single day.",
   "voice": "poppy",
   "tag": "[warm, smiling]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "At home, Mom sat on the porch holding a bracelet that spelled Poppy.",
   "tag": "[tender]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "She saw the raincoat. Then the Dot bracelet.",
   "tag": "[slow, building]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "And Mom laughed, hiccups and all.",
   "tag": "[joyful]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“It was you?”",
   "speak": "It was you?",
   "voice": "mom",
   "tag": "[laughing, amazed]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“Told you. Every single day.”",
   "speak": "Told you. Every single day.",
   "voice": "poppy",
   "tag": "[warm, smiling]",
   "pause": 0.08
  }
 ],
